hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"163","It was narrated by Yunus bin Abdul-Ala, it was narrated by Yahya bin Abdullah bin Bukayr, Al-Layth narrated to me, on the authority of Haywa, and he is Ibn Shurayh, on the authority of Uqba. Ibn Muslim, on the authority of Abdullah Ibn Al-Harith Ibn Juzz’ Al-Zubaidi, that he heard the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, say: “Woe to the heels and stomachs.” \feet of fire\"""""""
